#: ../../tools/icd_tools.rst:97 e1f8e609d3854e30898f4140f13415e8
msgid ""
"**Description**: Navigate the ICD-11 disease classification hierarchy by "
"retrieving child entities of a parent category. ICD-11 organizes diseases"
" in a hierarchical tree structure (chapters → categories → "
"subcategories). This tool returns all child entities under a specified "
"parent, showing the disease classification taxonomy. Useful for exploring"
" disease categories and understanding relationships. Requires "
"ICD\\_CLIENT\\_ID and ICD\\_CLIENT\\_SECRET."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/icd_tools.rst:101 0a438696e9014bcca8cb95eb124b4a69
msgid ""
"``entity_id`` (string) (required) Parent entity ID to browse (use empty "
"string or root ID for top-level chapters)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/icd_tools.rst:104 a4f9d60c101548308ad34505884dded0
msgid "``linearization`` (string) (optional) ICD-11 linearization to browse"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/icd_tools.rst:107 5eeb756b2f15407496b2f1cb7f6af767
msgid "``language`` (string) (optional) Language for results"
msgstr ""

