#: ../../tools/icd_tools.rst:134 97c8b86e6cd840d8af5064a74d65abf9
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed information about an ICD-11 disease entity "
"by its unique identifier or code. Returns comprehensive details including"
" full title, definition, inclusions, exclusions, parent/child "
"relationships, diagnostic criteria, and clinical descriptions. Essential "
"for understanding specific disease classifications. Requires "
"ICD\\_CLIENT\\_ID and ICD\\_CLIENT\\_SECRET."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/icd_tools.rst:138 01fba521f6cb46c3bd39a78a952feb8f
msgid ""
