#: ../../tools/icd_tools.rst:171 8a592e82090a41e2919710e8cbd08ac6
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search ICD-11 for diseases by name, symptoms, or "
"clinical terms. ICD-11 is the WHO's 11th revision of the International "
"Classification of Diseases, the global standard for diagnostic health "
"information. Returns matching disease entities with codes, titles, and "
"descriptions. Supports flexible search across 50+ languages. Requires "
"ICD\\_CLIENT\\_ID and ICD\\_CLIENT\\_SECRET (register free at "
"https://icd.who.int/icdapi)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/icd_tools.rst:175 027f91a1720b437093ac0b0925178585
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search query (disease name, symptom, or "
"clinical term, e.g., 'diabetes mellitus', 'hypertension', 'myocardial "
"infarction')"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/icd_tools.rst:178 25d1c479d33742f5ab31abcec6a58bb0
msgid ""
"``linearization`` (string) (optional) ICD-11 linearization to search "
"(default: 'mms' for mortality/morbidity statistics)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/icd_tools.rst:181 894c65181bff41dda0981f92d951bb16
msgid ""
"``flatResults`` (boolean) (optional) Return flat list of results (true) "
"or hierarchical structure (false)"
